ks it's a broad deal so  they're gonna use archival footage so  footage that they already have of stan  lee and put that footage into movies and  they'll probably shape it around some  type of a narrative that makes sense for  his cameo and they will also probably  use some cgi there as well since they  say they're going to use digital  technology and other forms besides  archival footage now some people like  this idea and some people don't some  people say let the man rest in peace  while others say this is probably what  stanley would have wanted and i have to  agree i think stan lee would think that  this is really cool i think using  archival footage would be a really  interesting way to keep him alive in the  marvel universe to have his heart and  soul still kind of in that world the  world in which he played a huge huge  role in creating he had cameos in almost  every marvel movie before he passed away  and i think this would be a really cool  way to carry on his spirit in that  universe but let me know what you think  in the comments down below do you like  this idea or do you think that they  should just stop all together don't  forget to like this video and subscribe  so you don't miss out on any of the  latest marvel news for live updates you  can follow me on instagram and twitter  and as always thank you all so much for  watching woof
 

